OL,3,ADiesel hits #2 a litre in UK for first
OL,4,Atime, as US pressures Europe to release
OL,5,Areserves
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis comment comes as diesel prices in
OL,8,Fthe UK hit record highs this week,
OL,9,Fhovering at just under 200p per litre,
OL,10,Faccording to motoring organisation the
OL,11,FRAC, as the Iran war puts pressure on
OL,12,Fthe supply
OL,14,FThe US is a vital supplier of diesel to
OL,15,Fthe world, exporting between 1.2 and
OL,16,F1.5 million barrels per day. More than
OL,17,Fhalf of the UK's diesel is imported,
OL,18,Fwith 31% coming from the US
OL,20,FEuropean ministers are meeting on
OL,21,FFriday to discuss the potential ban
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
