OL,3,AChris Mason: Why Andy Burnham's
OL,4,Aabout-turn on Manchester City matters
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt matters for Manchester, it matters
OL,7,Ffor the Premier League and so,
OL,8,Fcrucially, it matters for the UK's
OL,9,Fimage around the world ` because
OL,10,FEngland's top flight is a colossal
OL,11,Fglobal brand. In other words, this
OL,12,Fmatters whether you like football or
OL,13,Fnot.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
