OL,3,ANY's governor appoints special
OL,4,Aprosecutor in Cornell frat rape
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,F"New information has raised serious
OL,8,Fquestions about how this case was
OL,9,Fhandled, and I've lost faith in the
OL,10,FTompkins County DA's ability to fairly
OL,11,Foversee it," Hochul said.
OL,13,FThe announcement means District
OL,14,FAttorney Van Houten is no longer
OL,15,Foverseeing the case.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
